     "hidden": true,
     "text": "Ruling: Audit: at 3 d alpha-SMA shows no difference (~1.0, 1.13, 1.11) and CTGF and Col-I show HA ~ Si-HA, against the text's 'same order at each ti"
    }
   ],
   "question": "The text claims Si-HA drives higher fibrogenic gene expression in fibroblasts (CTGF, alpha-SMA, Col-I) than HA and Ti, with the same ranking holding at every time point. Do the mRNA panels in Figure 8b-8d support this?",
   "answer_key": "No. At 3 d the alpha-SMA panel (F8c) shows essentially no difference across conditions (~1.0, 1.13, 1.11), and the CTGF (F8b) and Col-I (F8d) panels show HA and Si-HA at about the same level, contradicting the text's claim of the same ranking order at each time point (o22).",
   "answer_scope": "full",
   "grading": "Answer key: the audit ruling on the panel, node o22 (graded target).",
   "answer_key_nodes": [
    "o22"
   ]
  },
